OL,3,GNEWSACat and Fiddle reopened early
OL,4,Aafter safety works
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the Peak District's best-known
OL,7,Froads has reopened after being closed
OL,8,Fto traffic since July.
OL,10,FThe A54, known as the Cat and Fiddle,
OL,11,Fwas due to be closed until late October
OL,12,Ffor maintenance and stabilisation work,
OL,13,Fbut has reopened three weeks ahead of
OL,14,Fschedule, Derbyshire County Council
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FThe work was the first phase of a #3m
OL,18,Frepair project to a 1.7km (one-mile)
OL,19,Fstretch of the route between the A53
OL,20,FLeek Road and the A537 at the
OL,21,FDerbyshire county boundary.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
